\ @ID 23
\ @TITLE TRACK 3: HOUSE OF RISING SUN
\ @SUBTITLE 朝日のあたる家 · 6/8 · 18 BARS · 1:1 MEDIA.HTML T3
\ @CATEGORY COMPOSITION
\ @PARTS 8
\ @PART 1 Bars 0-1: New Orleans Sunrise Intro
\ @PART 2 Bars 2-4: Verse 1A (Am-C-D)
\ @PART 3 Bars 5-6: Verse 1B (F-Am)
\ @PART 4 Bars 7-9: Verse 1C & E7 Turnaround
\ @PART 5 Bars 10-11: Forte Octave Chorus (Am-C)
\ @PART 6 Bars 12-13: Forte Octave Peak (D-F)
\ @PART 7 Bars 14-15: Forte Octave Resolve (Am-E7)
\ @PART 8 Bars 16-17: Waterfall Cascade & Am(add9) Coda
\ @SPEED 4.9383
\ @REVERB 0.26
\ @FORMULA 朝日のあたる家 (6/8, 18 Bars = 25.92s): Am-C-D-F-Am-C-E-E7 · shimGrandPiano + shimPedalBass

3.24 CONSTANT T3-TPART
1.44 CONSTANT T3-BAR
0.24 CONSTANT T3-EIGHTH

